body:
I had the same issue. Basically in algoliasearch v3 `getRecommendations` doesn't exist so everything in it is not typed. We can safely ignore this.

```suggestion
          // @ts-ignore
          // `request` will be implicitly typed as any in type-check:v3
          // since `getRecommendations` is not available there
          ...requests.map((request) => {
```

